}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:proficiencyAgent MUST be an owl:ObjectProperty and owl:FunctionalProperty — constitutive of LanguageProficiency (exactly one assessed agent). Mirrors test_reified_relators_and_functional_roles (proficiencyAgent role arm)." .

