}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:proficiencyLevel MUST be an owl:ObjectProperty and owl:FunctionalProperty — exactly one level per proficiency relator. Mirrors test_reified_relators_and_functional_roles (proficiencyLevel role arm)." .

# --- 10. proficiencyScale is a functional ObjectProperty (MUST)
ex:saProficiencyScaleFunctional a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
ASK {
    gmeow:proficiencyScale a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:proficiencyScale MUST be an owl:ObjectProperty and owl:FunctionalProperty — exactly one framework per proficiency relator. Mirrors test_reified_relators_and_functional_roles (proficiencyScale role arm)." .

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GROUP 3: Value vocabularies — logic:QualityValue subclasses (MUST)
# Mirrors test_value_vocabularies_not_subclasses (non-logic: arms).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- 11. LanguageOrigin is a logic:AbstractIndividualType subclassing logic:QualityValue (MUST)
ex:saLanguageOriginIsValueVocab a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
ASK {
    gmeow:LanguageOrigin a owl:Class , logic:AbstractIndividualType ;
        rdfs:subClassOf logic:QualityValue .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:LanguageOrigin MUST be an owl:Class typed logic:AbstractIndividualType and a subclass of logic:QualityValue — origins are an open individuals-based value vocabulary, never Language subclasses (Principle 9). Mirrors test_value_vocabularies_not_subclasses (LanguageOrigin class arm)." .

# --- 12. LanguageOrigin seed individuals exist (MUST)
ex:saLanguageOriginSeeds a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
ASK {
    gmeow:originNatural        a gmeow:LanguageOrigin .
    gmeow:originAiGenerated    a gmeow:LanguageOrigin .
    gmeow:originProgramming    a gmeow:LanguageOrigin .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "Sample LanguageOrigin individuals (originNatural, originAiGenerated, originProgramming) MUST exist as typed individuals. Mirrors test_value_vocabularies_not_subclasses (LanguageOrigin sample individuals arm)." .

# --- 12b. LanguageVarietyKind and LanguageChangeType are logic:QualityValue vocabs (MUST)
ex:saVarietyAndChangeKindsAreValueVocabs a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
ASK {
    gmeow:LanguageVarietyKind rdfs:subClassOf logic:QualityValue .
    gmeow:kindDialect  a gmeow:LanguageVarietyKind .
    gmeow:kindSociolect a gmeow:LanguageVarietyKind .
    gmeow:kindRegister a gmeow:LanguageVarietyKind .

    gmeow:LanguageChangeType rdfs:subClassOf logic:QualityValue .
    gmeow:changeSoundShift a gmeow:LanguageChangeType .
    gmeow:changeBorrowing  a gmeow:LanguageChangeType .
    gmeow:changeExtinction a gmeow:LanguageChangeType .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "LanguageVarietyKind and LanguageChangeType MUST be logic:QualityValue vocabularies with their canonical seed individuals. Replaces stale gufo:QualityValue pytest assertions." .

ex:saLanguageStateIsObservationRelator a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
ASK {
    gmeow:LanguageState a owl:Class ;
        rdfs:subClassOf gmeow:Observation , logic:Relator .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:LanguageState MUST be an Observation and logic:Relator for standpoint-scoped language-state claims. Replaces the stale gufo:Relator pytest assertion." .

