        rdfs:subClassOf logic:QualityValue .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:LanguageModality MUST be an owl:Class typed logic:AbstractIndividualType and a subclass of logic:QualityValue — modalities are an open individuals-based value vocabulary. Mirrors test_value_vocabularies_not_subclasses (LanguageModality class arm)." .

