    gmeow:scaleILR   a gmeow:ProficiencyScale .
    gmeow:scaleACTFL a gmeow:ProficiencyScale .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "Sample ProficiencyScale individuals (scaleCEFR, scaleILR, scaleACTFL) MUST exist as locally-defined typed individuals — the class is defined in slices/core/kernel/module.ttl but its seed individuals are defined here. Mirrors test_value_vocabularies_not_subclasses (ProficiencyScale sample individuals arm)." .

